===Etymology===
Via other European languages, ultimately from {{der|lv|ms|Jepang}}, itself from {{uder|lv|nan-hbl|日本|tr=Ji̍t-pún}}, from {{der|lv|ltc|日本|lit=sun origin}}, same etymon as {{cog|ja|日本|tr=[[Nippon]] / [[Nihon]]}}, made, like most other country names, into a feminine 4th-declension noun.

